            "review_title": "Review at Này Cafe",
            "review_text": "SatuKivist\nJyväskylä, Finland93 contributions\n0\nAmazying place\nJan 2025 • Couples\nNày Cafe is our favorite! We visited it every day during our nearly month-long holiday. The service has always been incredibly friendly and fast. Above all, the atmosphere and decor of the place are stylishly relaxed. Everyone is so friendly and nice. An absolutely amazing place! The prices are reasonable. The café is located by a charming canal. And best of all, the internet works perfectly in the café. Elsewhere in Hanoi, we've had trouble getting a reliable internet connection. Simply the best place in Hanoi!\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2025",
